      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "rfk-jr",
      "voiceName": "Robert F. Kennedy Jr.",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "KC-10 Driver \u2708\ufe0f \ud83d\udc68\u200d\u2708\ufe0f B-737 Wrangler (@MCCCANM)\n\nThis guy just has the most random encounters with animals of anyone you\u2019ve ever heard of &amp; it\u2019s kind of incredible at this point. I fully expect to see him riding a giraffe at some point &amp; it will kind of make sense somehow.\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/MCCCANM/status/2051125735327506523#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/RobertKennedyJr/status/2051311160364859730",
