      "voiceId": "rfk-jr",
      "voiceName": "Robert F. Kennedy Jr.",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Haha Alex. Very funny.\n\n\nAlex Clark (@yoalexrapz)\n\nThis is what happens when @RobertKennedyJr uncovers a corn syrup cover-up so sinister that he physically CANNOT put a shirt back on until justice is served\n\n\ud83d\ude2d\ud83d\ude2d made with @imagine\n\nVideo\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/yoalexrapz/status/2040204083794178253#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/RobertKennedyJr/status/2040221269564530793",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-04T00:13:50+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "rfk-jr",
      "voiceName": "Robert F. Kennedy Jr.",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Sl\u00e1inte from my family to yours during this week of celebrating the Irish. My father marching in the 1968 St. Patrick\u2019s day parade.",
